; ========================================
; ＞『玄関ホール』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_11_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛走到玄关大厅时，<br>看到了雪莉。|#0103Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR16

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛！|#0103Adv07_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉，正好遇到你。<br>我是来邀请你去野餐的。|#0103Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR15

[PrintTextModified Text:就知道是这件事～！<br>我也正这么想呢，你看！我找到了这个哦～！|#0103Adv07_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉得意洋洋地举起一把扫帚。<br>|#0103Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR11

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，这是什么？|#0103Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:扫帚啊！|#0103Adv07_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这个我看得出来啦。|#0103Adv07_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1,ArmR10,ArmL11

[PrintTextModified Text:之前找的时候都没有那种特别有<br>“扫帚感”的，感觉很不满足……|#0103Adv07_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR17,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:所以我一直在找，<br>就是要找那种标准的扫帚！|#0103Adv07_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:清洁工具间里倒是没有，<br>但是！在玄关前发现了这个！|#0103Adv07_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:说着，<br>雪莉神秘兮兮地凑到艾玛耳边。|#0103Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的目光，<br>投向了站在门口的看守。|#0103Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆コソコソ内緒話風に

[PrintTextModified Text:那个看守，看起来蛮吓人的，<br>却会认真打扫呢……！|#0103Adv07_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到雪莉的悄悄话，<br>艾玛也不由得看向看守。|#0103Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

; ========================================
; 立ち絵：看守（カメラ付き差分）表示d
; ========================================

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv07_Jailer001| AuthorId:Jailer RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看守一如既往地站在那里一动不动，<br>让人分不清是死是活。|#0103Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:毕竟总要有人<br>负责做饭、打扫和补充衣物呢……|#0103Adv07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:应该是在我们禁止外出的时间做这些事吧。<br>真是勤劳呢～|#0103Adv07_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1,ArmR6

[PrintTextModified Text:啊～获得新情报真是令人开心～|#0103Adv07_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着雪莉闪闪发亮的眼神，<br>艾玛一脸困惑。|#0103Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:但、但是这把扫帚，<br>你要用来做什么？|#0103Adv07_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（难道是我孤陋寡闻，<br>　野餐还需要带扫帚吗……？）|#0103Adv07_Ema006|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1,ArmR1

[PrintTextModified Text:这个嘛，暂时保密！|#0103Adv07_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那我先走一步啦！|#0103Adv07_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉拿着扫帚，<br>开心地蹦蹦跳跳离开了。|#0103Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（怎么办……完全不明白……）|#0103Adv07_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛只能理解一点：<br>雪莉永远都是这么开朗、充满活力。|#0103Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

